mul_mm.metal and dequantize.h are unchanged upstream files. SOURCE.json
records their upstream paths, sizes, SHA256 hashes, and source archive pin.
Both files and LICENSE were checked byte for byte against that archive.

The test-only calibration extracts the portable kernel and two dequantizers
from these files. They are not a second inference backend. The checked source
lines are fixed by the complete-file hashes; do not update the reference or
numeric bounds merely to make a changed implementation pass.
